  "behavior": [
    "Opt-in policy, exact attempt identity, deadlines, durable throttling and clock rollback are stored in the existing locked Document.",
    "Automatic renewal derives its due date from actual current profile expiry, snapshots the real current Bundle into a bounded IPA and reuses the explicit signing/install/data-handoff path.",
    "Existing ready candidates are freshly validated and submitted without preparing again; unknown remote results run recovery only.",
    "Foreground and granted BGProcessingTask execution use the same Session and actual persistence owners, with cancellation and worker drain before completion.",
    "Settings exposes opt-in, current status and a throttled check; the physical-device package build number is 13."
  ],
