  },
  "limitations": [
    "Live anisette/DeveloperServices is still unconfigured in the production owner. No credentials are embedded.",
    "The App needs a usable pairing identity in its Keychain and a genuinely reachable authenticated Lockdown installation endpoint.",
    "A background-only cold launch that never binds the existing App stores fails on expiration; foreground remains available. No replacement store is constructed.",
    "A transport receipt does not establish installation, expiration extension or preserved data. These need actual device observations."
  ],
